  "claim": "*Match the mechanism to the property.* An obligation may be held structurally by excluding the invalid state, evaluated by exploring reachable states, or checked as a temporal property over executions (for example with TLA+/TLC). These are alternatives selected by the engineering claim. A gate is a separate decision that enforces the resulting verdict.",
